	quest.7C3D740DA5D9A172.quest_desc: [
		"Artifacts are rare trinkets found in dungeon chests and mimics. Relics level up as you use them and unlock stronger abilities."
		""
		"§eHow:§r put them in your accessory slots (the Curios button in your inventory). Collect some emeralds; villagers and wandering traders sometimes sell treasure."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot 3 x Emerald and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
